title: DanielTest
---
Daniel: What are you staring at?

-> Ask about Mercer.
    Avery: Have you seen Dr. Mercer?
    Daniel: Maybe.
    <<jump DanielTest>>

-> Tell me what happened.
    Avery: Tell me what you took from Mercer.
    <<learn "event.daniel_stole_key">>
    Daniel: You have no idea what you're talking about.
    <<jump DanielTest>>

<<if knows("event.daniel_stole_key")>>
    -> Confront him about the key.
        Avery: I know you stole Mercer's brass key.
        Daniel: ...Who told you that?
        <<jump DanielTest>>
<<endif>>

-> Leave.
    Avery: Never mind.
===
